# CODEOWNERS
#
# This file defines who is automatically requested for review when a
# pull request touches matching paths. It also allows enabling
# "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch protection ruleset.
#
# Order matters: the last matching pattern in this file takes
# precedence. See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
# for full syntax.

# Default owner for everything in the repo, unless overridden below.
* @privateMwb

# Deployment and security-sensitive paths (these can break or expose the live demo).
/render.yaml            @privateMwb
/Dockerfile*            @privateMwb
/scripts/gateway.mjs    @privateMwb
/.github/               @privateMwb
/SECURITY.md            @privateMwb
